  <!-- ============================================================
       S+E technical config
       ============================================================
       What editors set here: the video backdrop (blank leaves the
       section on its solid fill) and the insight-card source mode
       (DCR-picker vs. auto-latest vs. manual). Feed URLs, tag
       keywords, and the pin/override URLs sit at the bottom.
